--TEST--
`prepareRename` on a property's own declaration answers the range of its name with the `$` the declaration writes, without the modifiers and the type, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public string $na<|>me = "";
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:4:19-4:24
